    "catalogue_description": "First of all, hello everyone, how are you? I hope they are very well. Well I bring you a fairly simple map to play. It is a map inspired by spirals like Cheese Cube and others. Obviously my map is not as great as those maps that are quite good but well that\u2019s where my inspiration was to create and bring this map that I made. You\u2019re probably wondering why I\u2019m uploading this map now if it\u2019s too soon and it\u2019s for the simple fact that since the holidays are already around the corner it occurred to me to leave it prepared beforehand so I hope you enjoy it and I\u2019m sorry I separated the modes into 2 links, it happens that A menu with different game modes will not yet be created, but I hope you enjoy it. Anyway, I leave you with the info and I hope you have a Merry Christmas and Happy New Year!",
